WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.834
-President Trump sat down

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:02.935
for an interview
with Axios recently,

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.537
where he said
many ridiculous things.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:07.106
Perhaps the most ridiculous,
however,

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:08.941
was this comment he made

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:11.610
while discussing the late
Congressman John Lewis.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.579
-Nobody has done more
-Right.

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:16.082
-for Black Americans
than I have.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.018
-Here to talk about it is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin.

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:20.819
-Hi, Seth.
-So, Amber,

00:00:20.819 --> 00:00:22.822
what did you think when you
heard Donald Trump say,

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.624
"No one's done more
for Black Americans

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:25.624
than I have"?

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:27.026
-I think he's correct.

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.361
-You don't disagree
with that statement?

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:32.165
-Why should I?
It's true.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.233
-It is?
-It is.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:35.367
-How is that possible?

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:36.870
I mean, what has he done?

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.471
-What has Trump done
for Black people? Well...

00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:42.141
[ Upbeat jazz plays ]

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:43.943 line:0%
He's done this...

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.278
♪♪

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:46.712 line:0%
He's done that...

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.715 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.184 line:0%
He's done this and this
and this...

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.186 line:0%
Don't you forget about that...

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:57.089 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:57.089 --> 00:00:58.758
♪♪

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.826
-But those are all bad things.

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:03.462
-He didn't say he's done
good things for Black people.

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:06.565
He just no one has done more,
and he's right.

00:01:06.565 --> 00:01:09.001
No one has done more
for Black Americans.

00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:10.570
To make our lives worse!

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.472
♪♪

